<%# The episodes of this post's podcast, or the tracks of its release, as a
    collapsible playlist the page's player plays through. Episodic shows run
    newest first, serial shows oldest first, releases in track order. Only
    for two or more. Skipped when the body has a playlist of its own. %>
<% if kind == "post" && record.post_type.in?(%w[podcast music]) && (playlist = record.series_playlist_html).present? %>
  <div class="post-playlist"><%= playlist.html_safe %></div>
<% end %>
